{"channelId":"UChogBFw4XE8KGCEFJD3MGgw","row":["Real Horse Rescues",465,"REAL HORSE RESCUES is an original series created and hosted by award-winning producer Susan Kayne on ABC-WTEN Every Saturday at 6:00AM. Its mission is to raise public awareness of equine welfare concerns, and bring visibility to the compassionate work of equine sanctuaries, rescues, and adoption organizations. Guests range from boots-on-the-ground rescuers, to legislators, to celebrities, to young advocates, and of course many four-legged stars.\n\nRHR focuses on rescue success stories to encourage viewers to participate directly with equine organizations in their communities to give horses a second chance. Real Horse Rescues is a program of the Unbridled Thoroughbred Foundation, a 501 c (3) not-for-profit educational organization guided by the belief that every equine life deserves humane treatment, compassion, respect, and protection from harm.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChogBFw4XE8KGCEFJD3MGgw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChogBFw4XE8KGCEFJD3MGgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:04.304Z","channelId":"UChogBFw4XE8KGCEFJD3MGgw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"8925e72f14b560b1b964ec29ce33d9fab6591e8b1bcddb4dc68928f942dad29a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"93cf39605e628688238c562dedc6aea1d813381c256b64ee07a4fe4aac9fadb1"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChogBFw4XE8KGCEFJD3MGgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:04.304Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChogBFw4XE8KGCEFJD3MGgw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":465,"raw":"465 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChogBFw4XE8KGCEFJD3MGgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:04.304Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant